Subject: [PATCH 6/6] feat(schools): add Business Impact Delta to strategist
 page

Adds a No-Action / With-Action exposure projection using the shared
TSMBNCAExposureEngine (same engine as Insurance/RE/Healthcare/BPO/
FinOps/Legal/HotelOps/Mortgage). Base exposure reuses
financials.total_exposure -- a figure schools-engine.js already
computes deterministically from the financial_model rate card
(funding_delay_cost_per_day x SLA-breach hours, plus
compliance_exposure_by_severity x open exceptions) and already
includes in the relay payload; the strategist page just wasn't reading
it. Severity is banded from the grants-over-SLA ratio, mirroring
Mortgage's severityFromSlaRatio() exactly.

Honesty pattern: if total_exposure is 0, shows the engine's own
financial_model.note (when present) instead of a misleadingly clean
$0 delta.
